WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.257 --> 00:00:11.318
hurried into the gym.

2
00:00:11.338 --> 00:00:13.299
"Guess what!"

3
00:00:13.419 --> 00:00:14.119
Bobby said.

4
00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:16.361
"We're going outside today."

5
00:00:16.381 --> 00:00:20.503
"It's sunny and warm," Izzie said.

6
00:00:20.523 --> 00:00:24.005
"That stinks," Ethan mumbled.

7
00:00:24.025 --> 00:00:26.647
"Huh?" Jason said.

8
00:00:27.447 --> 00:00:28.628
Everybody was surprised.

9
00:00:29.384 --> 00:00:32.166
Ethan was from California, and he loved warm weather.

10
00:00:33.147 --> 00:00:33.967
Ethan sighed.

11
00:00:33.987 --> 00:00:37.470
"I'm still saving up to buy a snowboard.

12
00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:40.091
But all the snow has melted."

13
00:00:40.111 --> 00:00:43.494
"Winter's not over yet," Izzie said.

14
00:00:43.514 --> 00:00:45.595
"Maybe it will snow again."

15
00:00:45.615 --> 00:00:49.718
"Time to go outside," Miss Shelly called.

16
00:00:51.479 --> 00:00:53.700
The kids followed the teacher out to the blacktop.

17
00:00:54.561 --> 00:00:55.922
She was holding a soft ball.

18
00:00:55.942 --> 00:00:57.883
"What are we playing?"

19
00:00:58.083 --> 00:00:58.824
Jason asked.

20
00:01:00.196 --> 00:01:01.897
"Spud," Miss Shelly said.

21
00:01:01.917 --> 00:01:03.718
"What's that?"

22
00:01:04.098 --> 00:01:04.898
Nina asked.

23
00:01:04.918 --> 00:01:08.340
"It's a fun game," Bobby said.

24
00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:12.841
"First, everyone needs a number," Miss Shelly said.

25
00:01:12.861 --> 00:01:14.762
"Let's count off."

26
00:01:16.103 --> 00:01:17.703
"One!" "Two!"

27
00:01:17.723 --> 00:01:20.064
"Three!" "Four!"

28
00:01:20.084 --> 00:01:24.206
"Five!" Miss Shelly gave the ball to Ethan.

29
00:01:24.886 --> 00:01:26.807
"You'll throw the ball up in the air.

30
00:01:27.688 --> 00:01:30.429
As you do that, call out someone's number."

31
00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:33.090
She looked at the others.

32
00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:37.613
"If you hear your number, run to catch the ball.

33
00:01:38.513 --> 00:01:40.375
Catch it and yell 'spud.'"

34
00:01:40.395 --> 00:01:43.136
"What does everyone else do?"

35
00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:44.297
Izzie asked.

36
00:01:44.317 --> 00:01:49.900
"You have to freeze when you hear 'spud,'" Bobby said.

37
00:01:50.981 --> 00:01:51.681
Izzie nodded.

38
00:01:51.701 --> 00:01:53.262
"Let's play!"

39
00:01:55.223 --> 00:01:56.924
Everyone started running around Ethan.

40
00:01:57.920 --> 00:01:59.380
He threw the ball into the air.

41
00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:02.381
"Five!" "That's me!"

42
00:02:02.861 --> 00:02:03.742
Jason cried.

43
00:02:04.782 --> 00:02:07.082
He caught the ball and yelled, "Spud."

44
00:02:07.963 --> 00:02:08.903
Everyone froze.

45
00:02:08.923 --> 00:02:14.424
"Jason, take three giant steps toward any player.

46
00:02:15.145 --> 00:02:17.545
Then throw the ball," Miss Shelly said.

47
00:02:18.346 --> 00:02:19.246
Jason grinned.

48
00:02:19.266 --> 00:02:21.106
"Can I throw it at Bobby?"

49
00:02:22.307 --> 00:02:23.307
Bobby grinned back.

50
00:02:23.327 --> 00:02:27.308
"If you miss me, or I catch it, you get an S."

51
00:02:29.392 --> 00:02:34.717
"Once you get S, P, U, D, you're out of the game," Miss Shelly said.

52
00:02:35.757 --> 00:02:37.799
Jason took three steps and threw the ball.

53
00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:39.541
Bobby caught it.

54
00:02:40.702 --> 00:02:41.903
"S for Jason!"

55
00:02:43.043 --> 00:02:45.265
Everyone ran around until Bobby threw the ball.

56
00:02:45.285 --> 00:02:49.969
"Two!" That was Nina's number.

57
00:02:52.011 --> 00:02:54.353
She caught the ball and called, "Spud."

58
00:02:55.814 --> 00:02:57.936
Then she threw it at Ethan, but she missed him.

59
00:02:59.732 --> 00:03:00.392
"S for me!"

60
00:03:00.732 --> 00:03:01.373
Nina said.

61
00:03:01.393 --> 00:03:03.433
"Your turn to throw, Ethan."

62
00:03:05.554 --> 00:03:09.815
When it was Bobby's turn to throw again, he yelled, "Thirteen!"

63
00:03:09.835 --> 00:03:13.236
"Huh?" Everyone froze.

64
00:03:14.476 --> 00:03:15.297
Bobby laughed.

65
00:03:15.857 --> 00:03:18.658
"Thirteen is a 'ghost' number.

66
00:03:19.218 --> 00:03:21.859
That means everyone runs for the ball and touches it.

67
00:03:22.459 --> 00:03:24.620
The last one to reach the ball gets a letter."

68
00:03:28.776 --> 00:03:32.058
Ethan was the first player to get S, P, U, D.

69
00:03:33.359 --> 00:03:34.359
He sat on a bench.

70
00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:38.121
When Izzie got out next, she headed toward Ethan.

71
00:03:39.342 --> 00:03:41.083
Then she spotted something in the grass.

72
00:03:41.103 --> 00:03:44.044
"Whoa! Five dollars!"

73
00:03:45.245 --> 00:03:47.326
Izzie and Ethan showed the money to Miss Shelly.

74
00:03:47.346 --> 00:03:50.968
"Take it to the office," Miss Shelly said.

75
00:03:50.988 --> 00:03:54.890
"If no one has reported losing it, you can keep it, Izzie."

76
00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:57.952
"I'll give it to Ethan," Izzie said.

77
00:03:58.392 --> 00:03:59.913
"For his snowboard."

78
00:04:00.594 --> 00:04:01.454
Ethan grinned.

79
00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:02.995
"Thanks, Izzie!"

80
00:04:05.197 --> 00:04:07.658
Soon only Jason and Bobby were left in the game.

81
00:04:08.819 --> 00:04:10.080
Jason was the thrower.

82
00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:13.683
"Ninety-nine!" Bobby froze.

83
00:04:16.525 --> 00:04:17.425
Jason laughed.

84
00:04:17.986 --> 00:04:19.607
"Ghost number, Bobby!

85
00:04:19.927 --> 00:04:21.588
You were supposed to run for the ball!"

86
00:04:22.268 --> 00:04:25.251
"Oops!" Bobby groaned.

87
00:04:25.271 --> 00:04:27.092
"You win."

88
00:04:28.264 --> 00:04:30.127
Everyone gave Jason a high five.

89
00:04:32.189 --> 00:04:34.933
On the way back inside, Ethan noticed some clouds.

90
00:04:35.694 --> 00:04:37.396
A chilly breeze whipped the trees.

91
00:04:37.416 --> 00:04:40.400
"Hmm," Ethan thought.

92
00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:43.284
"Maybe winter isn't over yet."
